    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme Daudi na viongozi wa Walawi, waliwateua baadhi ya wana wa Asafu, wa Hemani, na wa Yeduthuni, kuongoza katika huduma ya kutabiri kwa kutumia vinubi, na vinanda na matoazi. Hii ndiyo orodha ya wale waliochaguliwa kuongoza ibada, pamoja na aina ya kazi iliyofanywa na kila kikundi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana wanne wa Asafu: Zakuri, Yosefu, Nethania na Asharela. Wao walikuwa chini ya uongozi wa Asafu aliyetabiri wakati wote chini ya uongozi wa mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wana sita wa Yeduthuni: Gedalia, Seri, Yeshaya, Shimei, Hashabia na Matithia. Wao walikuwa chini ya uongozi wa baba yao; na walitabiri kwa kutumia vinubi, na wakamshukuru na kumtukuza Mwenyezi-Mungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wa Hemani: Bukia, Matania, Uzieli, Shebueli, Yeremothi, Hanania, Hanani, Eliatha, Gidalti, Romamti-ezeri, Yoshbekasha, Malothi, Hothiri na Mahaziothi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungu alimpa Hemani, mwonaji wa mfalme, hawa watoto wa kiume kumi na wanne, na wa kike watatu, kama alivyoahidi ili kumtukuza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wanawe wote walipiga muziki kwa matoazi, vinanda na vinubi, kwenye ibada katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu wakiwa chini ya uongozi wa baba yao. Asafu, Yeduthuni na Hemani walikuwa chini ya amri ya mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Idadi yao pamoja na wale ndugu zao Walawi waliofundishwa kumwimbia Mwenyezi-Mungu, wote waliokuwa stadi, ilikuwa 288. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wote, wakubwa kwa wadogo, waalimu kwa wanafunzi, walitumia kura katika kupanga kazi zao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
